# 7-Multi-Tenant-LLM-API
# Empty placeholders only. Never commit .env or real credentials.
# Configure only what you use; remove unused assignments before loading .env.
# Empty is not always equivalent to unset and can override working defaults/keys.
# Provider adapters and admin auth read the process environment; run.cmd loads .env.
# AGNES_API_KEY takes precedence over its AGNESAI_API_KEY alias.
# HOST, PORT and ADMIN_UI_PORT configure run.cmd only. ADMIN_TOKEN is not a tenant key.

OLLAMA_HOST=
AGNES_API_KEY=
OPENAI_API_KEY=
OPENAI_BASE_URL=
GOOGLE_API_KEY=
AGNESAI_API_KEY=
ADMIN_TOKEN=
HOST=
PORT=
ADMIN_UI_PORT=
